# MovieRecommender2 — project context

## Goal

Stream MovieLens 25M dataset events through Kafka, persist interaction data in Postgres, and index movie catalog features in OpenSearch for search/recommendation.

## Dataset (`datasets/ml-25m/`, mounted at `/data` in Compose)

| File | Schema | Status |
|------|--------|--------|
| `ratings.csv` | userId, movieId, rating, timestamp | **In pipeline** (producer → Kafka → consumer → Postgres) |
| `tags.csv` | userId, movieId, tag, timestamp | **In pipeline** |
| `movies.csv` | movieId, title, genres (~62k rows) | **Bootstrap** via `index-catalog` → OpenSearch |

## Architecture

```text
ratings/tags → Kafka producer → Kafka → consumer → Postgres (events)

movies.csv → index-catalog (Job) → OpenSearch movies_v2 (kNN) → alias `movies`
              ↑ embedder :8100 (all-MiniLM-L6-v2, 384d)

recommender-api POST /movies → Postgres catalog_movies (pending_sync=true)
catalog-indexer-api POST /index/movie/{id} → embedder → OpenSearch (immediate sync)
index-sync (Job) → embedder → bulk upsert pending rows to OpenSearch alias

recommender-api GET /search → OpenSearch alias (lexical)
recommender-api GET /search/similar → embedder + OpenSearch kNN
```

**Interview line:** CSV bootstraps the search index once; API-added catalog lives in Postgres as source of truth and syncs incrementally to OpenSearch with embeddings. User events still stream via Kafka.

## Current stack

- **Kafka**, **Postgres 17**, **OpenSearch 2.19**
- **Producer / consumer** — ratings & tags; DLQ; health on `:8080`
- **Embedder** — `sentence-transformers/all-MiniLM-L6-v2`; `POST /embed`, `/health` on `:8100`
- **Indexing** — `index-catalog` (CSV batch), `index-sync` (Postgres → OpenSearch); all writes enrich docs via `build_index_document`
- **Postgres** — `ratings_events`, `tag_events`, `dead_letter_events`, **`catalog_movies`**
- **recommender-api** — `GET /search`, `GET /search/similar`, `POST /movies`, `GET /catalog/pending-sync`, `/health` on `:8000`
- **catalog-indexer-api** — `POST /index/movie/{id}` on `:8101`

### Compose profiles

| Profile | Services |
|---------|----------|
| `stream` / `ratings` / `tags` | Kafka pipeline |
| `catalog` | `embedder`, `index-catalog`, `index-sync`, `create-movie-index`, `index-movies` |
| `api` | `embedder`, `recommender-api`, `catalog-indexer-api` (+ `migrate`) |

**Runbook:**
1. Set `INDEX_VERSION=v2` and `RECREATE_INDEX=true` in `services/indexing/.env` when rebuilding locally
2. `docker compose --profile catalog up --build embedder index-catalog` (embedder + full CSV reindex with vectors)
3. `docker compose --profile api up --build recommender-api` (starts embedder, catalog-indexer-api, API)
4. Test: `curl embedder:8100/health/ready`, `GET /search/similar?q=inception`, `POST /movies?sync=immediate=true` → `GET /search/similar?movie_id=...`
5. Async catalog: `POST /movies` → `docker compose --profile catalog run index-sync`

## Deferred

- `GET /recommend`, `POST /rate`
- Postgres seed of ML-25m into `catalog_movies` (CSV only seeds OpenSearch today)

